                <head>Treaty between the United States and Spain; friendship and general
                    relations</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Madrid, July 3, 1902.<lb/>Ratification advised
                        by the Senate, December 16, 1902.<lb/>Ratified by the President, February 6,
                        1903.<lb/>Ratified by Spain, March 30, 1903.<lb/>Ratifications exchanged at
                        Madrid, April 14, 1903.<lb/>Proclaimed, April 20, 1903</hi>.</p>

